---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import ColorBar from "../assets/color-bar.png";
import GitHubIcon from "devicon/icons/github/github-original.svg";
---

<header
    class="w-[210mm] flex items-center justify-between gap-8 bg-gray-50 shadow-xl print:hidden"
>
    <Image src={ColorBar} alt="color-bar" />
    <a
        target="_blank"
        href="https://github.com/Yue-plus/astro-resume-CV"
        class="text-lg font-bold text-center"
    >
        <GitHubIcon
            class="w-16 h-16 hover:rotate-360 transition-all ease-in-out duration-500"
        />
    </a>
    <div class="h-28.25 inline-flex items-stretch">
        <div class="p-8 flex items-center">
            注意在打印对话框中设置：
            <br />
            无边距；<wbr />不打印页眉页脚；<wbr />打印背景图形
            <!-- <ul>
                    <li>布局：纵向</li>
                    <li>纸张大小：A4</li>
                    <li>缩放：100%</li>
                    <li>边距：无</li>
                    <li>选项：不打印页眉页脚；打印背景图形</li>
                </ul> -->
        </div>
        <a
            target="_blank"
            href="/print"
            class="w-28.25 p-8 flex items-center lg:text-2xl font-bold bg-gray-200 hover:bg-end-yellow duration-150"
        >
            打印<br />简历
        </a>
        <a
            target="_blank"
            href="/刘悦阳的履历-全栈开发-20251202.pdf"
            class="w-28.25 p-8 flex items-center lg:text-2xl font-bold bg-gray-200 hover:bg-end-yellow duration-150"
        >
            下载<br />PDF
        </a>
    </div>
</header>
